        <p>Before submitting your next application, run through this checklist:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>☐ No typos or grammatical errors</li>
            <li>☐ Contact information is correct</li>
            <li>☐ Resume is tailored to the job</li>
            <li>☐ Achievements are quantified</li>
            <li>☐ All links work</li>
            <li>☐ Formatting is clean and readable</li>
